# Font Awesome Package Token Authentication
# 
# This file contains authentication credentials for the private Font Awesome npm registry.
# 
# Setup Instructions:
# 1. Create a new file called .npmrc in this directory (copy this file):
#    cp .npmrc.example .npmrc
# 2. Get your Font Awesome package token from: https://fontawesome.com/account/tokens
#    (This token is also stored in 1Password)
# 3. Replace YOUR_PACKAGE_TOKEN_HERE below with your actual token (keep the full UUID format)
# 4. Never commit .npmrc to git - it's in .gitignore for security
# 5. Run: pnpm install
#

@awesome.me:registry=https://npm.fontawesome.com/
//npm.fontawesome.com/:_authToken=YOUR_PACKAGE_TOKEN_HERE
